SUMMARY:Virtual: Gustav Klimt’s The Kiss
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nOn **Saturday\, August 1st\,** **discover 
 Gustav Klimt’s The Kiss -** the scandalous life and extraordinary influe
 nces behind one of the world’s favourite paintings. This film transports
  us to turn-of-the-century Vienna while exploring the painting’s strikin
 g details and hidden symbolism.\nNote: This content is only available in C
 anada.\n\n**COST**\nFree\n\n**SIGNING UP**\n\n* Simply RSVP Yes\n*\n\n**ME
 ETUP TIME**\n\n* **At 7pm: click on this [link](https://www.knowledge.ca/p
 rogram/klimt-the-kiss)**\n* Length: 1 hour\n* RSVPs close the same day\n*\
 n\nEnjoy and please post your Comments after!
