SUMMARY:Virtual: Experience a Sunset Total Solar Eclipse Live from Spain
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nOn **Wednesday\, August 12th\,** **experie
 nce a Sunset Total Solar Eclipse Live from Spain**. A total solar eclipse 
 will pass through Greenland\, Iceland and Spain\, with totality occurring 
 just before sunset. Join a University of Toronto astronomer live in Segovi
 a\, Spain for a chance to view the eclipse as it happens and to have your 
 questions answered on stream!\n\nThe live stream will start when the parti
 al eclipse begins at 1:30pm EDT (Toronto time) or 7:30pm CEST (local Spain
  time)\, and will continue until just after totality at roughly 8:30 pm lo
 cal time.\n\n**COST**\nFree\n\n**SIGNING UP**\n\n* Simply RSVP Yes\n*\n\n*
 *MEETUP TIME**\n\n* **At 1:30pm on: click on this [link](https://www.youtu
 be.com/live/W3Gnl-QqQv0?si=iurCvQq3KnbWJUdK)**\n* Length: 7 hours\, come a
 nd go as you please\n* RSVPs close the day prior\n*\n\nEnjoy and please po
 st your Comments after!
