SUMMARY:Virtual REGISTER:  Let Go and Love Your Life
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**Note: After you RSVP\, you will also nee
 d to Register to receive your link to the event.**\n\nOn **Wednesday\, Aug
 ust 19th\,** **join Let Go and Love Your Life:** **Pleasure as Power and L
 oving Your Life Even When You Hate What’s Happening.**\n**What if fallin
 g to your knees was not a collapse\, but a transformation?**\nAuthor Regen
 a Thomashauer explores what can happen when we let go of our need for cont
 rol. What happens when we find power in surrender\; autonomy in pleasure. 
 She explores what happens when women reconnect to their grief\, desire\, r
 age\, pleasure\, sensuality\, and aliveness.\n\n**COST**\nFree\n\n**SIGNIN
 G UP**\n\n* Simply RSVP Yes\n* **[Register](https://www.eventbrite.com/e/l
 et-go-and-love-your-life-with-regena-thomashauer-tickets-1993374354354)** 
 for the talk and you receive a confirmation email on how to access your zo
 om link to the event\n* **Start time: 3pm when you will click on link prov
 ided directly to you**\n* Length: 1 hour\n* RSVPs close 1 day prior to sta
 rt time\, hoping spots are still available\n*\n\nEnjoy and please post you
 r Comments after!
